# Amaca — React / Tailwind v4 target

Scoped rules for React (Vue/Svelte applicable) on Tailwind v4. The token discipline, laws, a11y floor, and never-ship list are in `amaca-core.mdc` (always loaded) — this file adds only what's React-specific.

**Tailwind v4 `@theme`** (from `styles/theme.css`, canonical mapping in `DESIGN.md → §13 Multi-deploy`): tokens are exposed as namespaced custom properties that auto-generate utilities. Prefer the utilities; the raw `var(--token)` form still works at runtime.

| token | namespaced | utilities |
|---|---|---|
| `--primary-500` | `--color-primary-500` | `bg-primary-500`, `text-primary-500`, `border-primary-500` |
| `--obsidian-800` | `--color-obsidian-800` | `bg-obsidian-800`, … |
| `--s-4` | `--spacing-4` | `p-4`, `px-4`, `gap-4`, … |
| `--r-md` | `--radius-md` | `rounded-md` |
| `--t-body` | `--text-body` | `text-body` |
| `--d-quick` / `--ease-decel` | `--duration-quick` / `--ease-decel` | `duration-quick` / `ease-decel` |

**Never hand-copy a token value into JS** — read it off `:root` at runtime (`getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--primary-500')`) or use the utility class. A literal hex/px in a component is a violation.

**Motion:** gate JS-driven animation behind `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` too, not just CSS transitions.

If `theme.css` has no `@theme {` block (only `:root {`), fall back to CSS-modules with raw `var(--token)` and flag the hand-off `compliance: best-effort`.

Reference pattern (utility-only, token-true):

```tsx
export function PrimaryButton({ children, ...props }: ButtonProps) {
  return (
    <button
      className="
        inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary-500 text-obsidian-050 border border-primary-500
        min-h-10 pointer-coarse:min-h-11 px-6 leading-none rounded-full shadow-sh-2 font-sans text-body font-medium tracking-snug
        transition-all duration-quick ease-standard
        hover:shadow-[var(--sh-glow),var(--sh-3)]
        focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-obsidian-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-3
        focus-visible:shadow-ring-halo
        disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed motion-reduce:transition-none
      "
      {...props}
    >
      {children}
    </button>
  );
}
```
